{"id":"649513","name":"盐焗五花肉","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649513/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"盐焗鸡粉","amount":"2包"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄栀子碎","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：五花肉（已清洗）、盐焗鸡粉、黄栀子碎、姜片。","img":"images/649513/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将五花肉放在案板上切开。","img":"images/649513/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盘中，加1勺盐。","img":"images/649513/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉搓均匀，腌制2个小时。","img":"images/649513/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，将腌制好的五花肉下入清水锅中。","img":"images/649513/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后，搁入姜片，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/649513/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐焗鸡粉。","img":"images/649513/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入黄栀子碎。","img":"images/649513/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入半勺盐。","img":"images/649513/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"调味烧煮25分钟。","img":"images/649513/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"关火，捞出。","img":"images/649513/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"晾凉。","img":"images/649513/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后，将晾凉好的五花肉放在切成片。","img":"images/649513/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"装盘，开吃。","img":"images/649513/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}